## Installation

<InstallCommand
  pnpm="pnpm add @coss-sv/ui @hugeicons/svelte @hugeicons/core-free-icons"
  shadcnSvelte="pnpm dlx shadcn-svelte@latest add https://coss-sv.vercel.app/r/kbd.json"
/>

## Usage

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
  import { Kbd } from "@coss-sv/ui";
</script>
```

## API Reference

The Svelte port preserves the COSS styling and forwards native attributes to the rendered element.

